2:T20c6,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov","givenName":"Omonbek","familyName":"Xojamurodov","alternateName":["Omonbek Khojamurodov","Omonbek Xo'jamurodov","Omonbek Xo‘jamurodov","Омонбек Хожамуродов","Omonbek","omonboyweb","the_khojamurodov"],"jobTitle":"Software Engineer & Frontend Architect","description":"Omonbek Xojamurodov (Omonbek Khojamurodov) — React, Next.js 15/16, TypeScript, Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) va TanStack Query bo‘yicha Software Engineer & Frontend Architect (eval42.uz). Multi-tenant CRM/ERP tizimlar, US Marketplace platformalar va biznes avtomatlashtirish yechimlari.","url":"https://eval42.uz","image":"https://eval42.uz/opengraph-image","email":"mailto:info@eval42.uz","telephone":"+998777774502","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Tashkent","addressCountry":"UZ"},"sameAs":["https://github.com/omonboyweb","https://www.linkedin.com/in/omonbekxojamurodov/","https://t.me/the_khojamurodov"],"knowsLanguage":["uz","en","ru"],"knowsAbout":["Software Engineering","Frontend Architecture","Next.js","React","TypeScript","Feature-Sliced Design (FSD)","TanStack Query","Multi-Tenant SaaS Architecture","Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)","Stripe Payment Integration","Google Maps API","CRM and ERP Systems","Excel (.xlsx) Reporting Automation"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#website","url":"https://eval42.uz","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov — Software Engineer & Frontend Architect","description":"Omonbek Xojamurodov (Omonbek Khojamurodov) — React, Next.js 15/16, TypeScript, Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) va TanStack Query bo‘yicha Software Engineer & Frontend Architect (eval42.uz). Multi-tenant CRM/ERP tizimlar, US Marketplace platformalar va biznes avtomatlashtirish yechimlari.","inLanguage":"uz-UZ","publisher":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"}},{"@type":"ProfilePage","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#profilepage","url":"https://eval42.uz","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov — Software Engineer & Frontend Architect | eval42.uz","description":"Omonbek Xojamurodov (Omonbek Khojamurodov) — React, Next.js 15/16, TypeScript, Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) va TanStack Query bo‘yicha Software Engineer & Frontend Architect (eval42.uz). Multi-tenant CRM/ERP tizimlar, US Marketplace platformalar va biznes avtomatlashtirish yechimlari.","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"inLanguage":"uz-UZ"},{"@type":"ProfessionalService","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#service","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov — Frontend & Software Engineering Services","url":"https://eval42.uz","telephone":"+998777774502","email":"info@eval42.uz","priceRange":"$$$","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Tashkent","addressCountry":"UZ"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"Country","name":"Uzbekistan"},{"@type":"Country","name":"United States"}],"provider":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"hasOfferCatalog":{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Muhandislik Xizmatlari","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","position":1,"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Frontend & Micro-Frontend Architecture","description":"React, Next.js (SSR/ISR/Server Components) va TypeScript asosida masshtablashuvchi, yuqori tezlikdagi veb-ilovalarni loyihalash. Izolyatsiyalangan modul chegaralari va nolga yaqin client-side JS yuklamasi."}},{"@type":"Offer","position":2,"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"API Integratsiya va State Management","description":"Backend xizmatlari bilan tiplangan (Type-Safe) integratsiya, ma’lumotlarni aqlli keshlash, optimistik UI yangilanishlari va murakkab global state boshqaruvi."}},{"@type":"Offer","position":3,"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Biznes Avtomatlashtirish va Hisobot Modullari","description":"Katta hajmdagi ma’lumotlar jadvallari, ko‘p qatlamli qidiruv/filtrlash va avtomatlashtirilgan Excel (.xlsx) hamda PDF eksport tizimlarini yuqori tezlikda ishlashini ta’minlash."}},{"@type":"Offer","position":4,"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"CRM, ERP va Boshqaruv Panellari","description":"Biznes jarayonlarini boshqarish uchun ko‘p rolli (RBAC) admin panellar, interaktiv statistik diagrammalar va ko‘p bosqichli murakkab formalar tizimini noldan qurish."}}]}},{"@type":"ItemList","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#projects-list","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov — Real Production Case Studies","itemListOrder":"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending","numberOfItems":3,"itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"CreativeWork","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#education-crm-platform","name":"Education CRM Platform (Multi-Tenant SaaS)","headline":"Education CRM Platform (Multi-Tenant SaaS) — Multi-Tenant SaaS · Security & FSD Architecture","description":"O‘quv markazlar uchun onlayn CRM platforma: har bir o‘quv markaz o‘z subdomenida ishlaydi, 7 xil rol (admin, o‘qituvchi, o‘quvchi va boshqalar) o‘z panelini ko‘radi. Men frontend xavfsizligi va kod arxitekturasi ustida ishladim.","author":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"keywords":"Next.js, TypeScript, TanStack Query, Feature-Sliced Design (FSD), httpOnly Cookies, Multi-Tenant RBAC"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"CreativeWork","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#halalhub-food-marketplace","name":"HalalHub (US Food Marketplace)","headline":"HalalHub (US Food Marketplace) — US Food Marketplace · Payments, Maps & Quality Audit","description":"Amerika bozoriga mo‘ljallangan taom buyurtma marketplace’i. Men to‘lov tizimi, xarita, autentifikatsiya, 4 til lokalizatsiyasi va topshirish oldidan sifat auditi ustida ishladim.","author":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"keywords":"Next.js 16, React 19, TanStack Query, Stripe Payments, Google Maps, i18n (EN/RU/UZ/AR)"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"CreativeWork","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#logistics-driver-director-system","name":"Logistika: Haydovchilar va Rahbar Boshqaruv Tizimi","headline":"Logistika: Haydovchilar va Rahbar Boshqaruv Tizimi — On-Site UX Discovery · Fleet & Executive Dashboard","description":"Logistika biznesi uchun ichki boshqaruv platformasi: biznesning o‘ziga bevosita borib, haydovchilar va korxona rahbari bilan birga yurib, har ikki tomon uchun eng qulay bo‘lgan ish jarayoni (UX), lokatsiya nazorati va hisobotlar tizimini yaratdim.","author":{"@id":"https://eval42.uz/#person"},"keywords":"Next.js, TypeScript, On-Site UX Research, Driver Mobile UI, Executive Dashboard, Excel (.xlsx) Export"}}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://eval42.uz/#faq-schema","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Omonbek Xojamurodov qaysi texnologiyalar va arxitekturada ishlaydi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Asosiy ixtisoslashuv — Next.js (14/15/16 App Router), React 19, TypeScript (Strict Mode), TanStack Query, Zustand va Tailwind CSS. Yirik loyihalarda kod chigallashib ketmasligi uchun Feature-Sliced Design (FSD) arxitekturasi va ESLint chegara qoidalari qo‘llaniladi."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Ko‘p rolli (RBAC) va ko‘p subdomenli (Multi-Tenant) CRM/ERP tizimlarda xavfsizlik qanday ta’minlanadi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Tokenlar brauzer xotirasida (localStorage) yoki URL’da saqlanmaydi. Next.js BFF server qatlami orqali httpOnly cookie’lardan foydalaniladi, 401 holatida sessiya serverda avtomatik yangilanadi va har bir rol (masalan, 7 xil rol) maxsus Route Guard orqali himoyalanadi."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Mavjud (chigallashgan yoki sekin ishlayotgan) frontend kod bazasini tartibga solib bera olasizmi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ha. Masalan, 730 ta fayl va 64,000 qatordan iborat CRM loyihada aylanali bog‘liqliklarni (circular dependencies) 8 tadan 2 taga, lint xatolarini 182 tadan 23 taga tushirib, kesh to‘qnashuvlarini yagona tiplangan `qk` reestri bilan to‘liq bartaraf etganman."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Yangi loyiha bo‘yicha qanday bog‘lanish mumkin va javob vaqti qancha?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Saytdagi tezkor loyiha brifi formasi (xabar to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri Telegram botga boradi), @the_khojamurodov Telegram manzili yoki +998 77 777 45 02 telefon raqami orqali bog‘lanishingiz mumkin. Odatda 2 soat ichida texnik javob beriladi."}}]}]}0:{"P":null,"b":"TD3-TuN-mQSXLfkuTexp_","p":"","c":["",""],"i":false,"f":[[["",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/326e0636688defec.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"uz","className":"__variable_64a611 __variable_bfdb28","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"font-sans bg-[#f6f9fc] text-[#425466] selection:bg-[#635bff] selection:text-white","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"#top","className":"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[100] focus:px-4 focus:py-2.5 focus:rounded-xl focus:bg-[#0a2540] focus:text-white focus:font-semibold focus:shadow-lg","children":"Asosiy tarkibga o'tish"}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$L3"]}]}]]}],{"children":["__PAGE__","$L4",{},null,false]},null,false],"$L5",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$6",[]],"s":false,"S":true}
